    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Horror x Thriller x Fantasy</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A surreal 2D side-scrolling puzzle-adventure.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Looking for clues: To reveal the truth of old cases.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter a bizarre and curious world and start a fantastical adventure.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Children in the apartment complex are searching for their missing friend, unwittingly becoming entangled in a decade-long murder case. <br>The residents, while avoiding the topic, whisper terrifying rumors behind closed doors.<br><br>Among them are a strange landlord couple, a murderer living in the penthouse, siblings traumatized by witnessing their mother's suicide, a creepy doctor practicing medicine illegally, and a grocery store owner obsessed with collecting shrouds.<br>The question looms : who is the perpetrator of these horrifying crimes?<br><br>Hidden in the dark corners of the apartment lies a secret unknown to all\u2014a tragic box reeking of death and the disturbing sound of crying echoing in the hallways.After tonight, the truth may be buried forever.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Horror x Thriller x Fantasy</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A surreal 2D side-scrolling puzzle-adventure.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Looking for clues: To reveal the truth of old cases.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter a bizarre and curious world and start a fantastical adventure.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/04a57eca8b228d7ae0ddfe3a2f41b359.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/7902077bec590d93e0222aeb8359d492.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Children in the apartment complex are searching for their missing friend, unwittingly becoming entangled in a decade-long murder case. <br>The residents, while avoiding the topic, whisper terrifying rumors behind closed doors.<br><br>Among them are a strange landlord couple, a murderer living in the penthouse, siblings traumatized by witnessing their mother's suicide, a creepy doctor practicing medicine illegally, and a grocery store owner obsessed with collecting shrouds.<br>The question looms : who is the perpetrator of these horrifying crimes?<br><br>Hidden in the dark corners of the apartment lies a secret unknown to all\u2014a tragic box reeking of death and the disturbing sound of crying echoing in the hallways.After tonight, the truth may be buried forever.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.poster.avif?t=1736273271\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.webm?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223260/extras/9ef6f4cfd6fccf806f23cfe3c12b1da2.mp4?t=1736273271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
